  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chicken and cook until it is browned on all sides.",
    "Add the curry powder, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the lime leaves and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and let the curry simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Serve the curry hot over rice or with some roti.",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
